Section Lift.
Variable RT : rt_sig.
Hypothesis AF : art_facts RT.
Hypothesis RIP : rip_stmt.
Hypothesis AF_IC : forall Σ m, ART RT Σ m -> icells m /\ icells_ms m /\ icells_mc m /\ icells_sn m /\ m2s_cells m.
